entries[162257] = { ["name"] = "Recipe: Demitri's Draught of Deception", ["text"] = "Rank 3\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to craft a Demitri's Draught of Deception more efficiently.\nChance to create multiple draughts.\nRequires Kul Tiran Alchemy (1)\nSell Price:\nDemitri's Draught of Deception\nUse: The imbiber gains invisibility for 18 sec. Ineffective above level 50. (5 Min Cooldown)\nSell Price:\nRequires Sand Shifter (5), Sea Stalk (5), Crystal Vial" }
