entries[162285] = { ["name"] = "Recipe: Kul Tiramisu", ["text"] = "Rank 3\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to craft Kul Tiramisu more effectively.\nYou don't waste a single ingredient, preparing much more Kul Tiramisu in each batch.\nRequires Kul Tiran Cooking (1)\nSell Price:\nKul Tiramisu\nUse: Restores 19231 health and 11538 mana over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating. If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain 24 Critical Strike for 1 hour.\nSell Price:\nRequires Wild Flour (10), Foosaka (5), Aromatic Fish Oil (2), Major's Frothy Coffee (5)" }
