entries[162287] = { ["name"] = "Recipe: Galley Banquet", ["text"] = "Rank 3\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to craft a Galley Banquet more effectively.\nPrepare Galley Banquets even more efficiently, using significantly fewer materials.\nRequires Kul Tiran Cooking (1)\nRequires Tortollan Seekers\n- Revered\nSell Price:\nGalley Banquet\nUse: Set out a Galley Banquet to feed up to 35 people in your raid or party!\n\nRestores 19231 health and 11538 mana over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating. If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain 35 in a stat for 1 hour.\nSell Price:\nRequires Briny Flesh (8), Thick Paleo Steak (8), Sand Shifter (8), Tiragarde Perch (8), Foosaka (10), Fresh Potato (25), Midnight Salmon" }
