entries[162322] = { ["name"] = "Schematic: Frost-Laced Ammunition", ["text"] = "Rank 3\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to craft Frost-Laced Ammunition more efficiently.\nGreatly reduce the materials required to craft Frost-Laced Ammunition.\nRequires Kul Tiran Engineering (1)\nRequires Order of Embers\n- Revered\nSell Price:\nFrost-Laced Ammunition\nUse: Permanently upgrades the ammunition of a ranged weapon, sometimes dealing a small amount of frost damage to your target and slowing them by 20% for 3 sec when dealing damage with ranged attacks.\n\nAttaching this device to a ranged weapon causes it to become soulbound.\nSell Price:\nRequires Monelite Ore (12), Chemical Blasting Cap (5), Insulated Wiring (5)" }
