entries[162331] = { ["name"] = "Schematic: F.R.I.E.D.", ["text"] = "Rank 3\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to craft a F.R.I.E.D. more efficiently.\nGreatly reduces the materials required to craft a F.R.I.E.D.\n\nChance to create multiple bombs.\nRequires Kul Tiran Engineering (1)\nSell Price:\nF.R.I.E.D.\nUse: Inflicts 4180 Fire damage to all enemies in a 5 yard radius. (5 Min Cooldown)\n\"Fast-Roasting Incendiary Exploding Device. NOT to be used for actual cooking.\"\nSell Price:\nRequires Monelite Ore (4), Chemical Blasting Cap (2), Insulated Wiring (4)" }
