entries[162337] = { ["name"] = "Schematic: Organic Discombobulation Grenade", ["text"] = "Rank 3\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to craft an Organic Discombobulation Grenade more efficiently.\nGreatly reduces the materials required to craft an Organic Discombobulation Grenade.\n\nChance to create multiple bombs.\nRequires Kul Tiran Engineering (1)\nRequires Storm's Wake\n- Revered\nSell Price:\nOrganic Discombobulation Grenade\nUse: Throw a bomb, which when detonated will summon 5 mechanical sheep. Any enemies that come into contact with the sheep will be polymorphed for 20 sec. Ineffective against targets above level 50. (1 Min Cooldown)\nSell Price:\nRequires Monelite Ore (4), Chemical Blasting Cap (2), Insulated Wiring (4)" }
